OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist equipment to deal with
OL,4,Adrone threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuthorities in Jersey have got new
OL,7,Fequipment to detect, assess and respond
OL,8,Fto future drone reports.
OL,10,FFlights were affected on Friday and
OL,11,FSaturday evening at the island's
OL,12,Fairport, causing major disruption.
OL,13,FPolice said an investigation was under
OL,14,Fway.
OL,16,FThere is increasing use of the small
OL,17,Funmanned aircraft for filming,
OL,18,Fphotography and light displays, but
OL,19,Fstrict rules are employed to keep
OL,20,Fairspace and maritime space safe and
OL,21,Ffunctional.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
