OL,3,GNEWSASpecialist equipment to deal with
OL,4,Adrone threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FMinister for Justice and Home Affairs
OL,7,FHelen Miles said: "Protecting public
OL,8,Fsafety and maintaining Jersey's
OL,9,Fconnectivity remain our priorities. We
OL,10,Fwill continue to work with police,
OL,11,FPorts of Jersey and partners to ensure
OL,12,Fthe island is as well prepared as
OL,13,Fpossible."
